
Plug-in
=============
manage jenkins -->available plugin --> docker pipeline
manage jenkins -->available plugin --> sonarqube scanner

step-1 create a token in sonarqube to connect jenkins 
================================================================
goto My account --> security --> token name & token-type (user token) and expiry --> generate 

step-2 Add sonar scannet to jenkins 
====================================
manage jenkins ---> tool ---> sonar code scanner ---> name (Sonarscan)  -- > select version(5.0.1.3) 

step-3 create global credentials for sonarqube tokens 
==============================================================
manage jenkins --> credentials --> system --> global credentials  ---> kind (secret text)  -->  secrete (user token)  --> ID (SonarQubeToken) --> Add 

step-4 create environment variable 
===========================================
manage jenkins --> system ---> environment variable --> sonarqube 

name - Sonarqube 
serverurl - http://IP:9000 (use private IP)
server authentication token  - ID (SonarQubeToken)


For sonar scan , point to jdk21 only for sonar scan 
=============================================================
#Add the Amazon Corretto Repository
sudo rpm --import https://yum.corretto.aws/corretto.key
sudo curl -L -o /etc/yum.repos.d/corretto.repo https://yum.corretto.aws/corretto.repo

#Install Java 21 Development Kit (JDK)
sudo yum install -y java-21-amazon-corretto-devel
java -version

Jenkins under Manage Jenkins ---> Tools (Global Tool Configuration) --->JDK when adding your Java 21 tool configuration!
JAVA_HOME= /usr/lib/jvm/java-21-amazon-corretto.x86_64

configure the stage in pipeline 
=====================================
stage('SonarQube Analysis') {
    steps {
        withSonarQubeEnv(installationName: 'Sonarqube', credentialsId: 'SonarToken') {
            script {
                // Properly bind the tool path to JAVA_HOME for this block
                def jdk21Path = tool name: 'java21', type: 'hudson.model.JDK'
                withEnv(["JAVA_HOME=${jdk21Path}", "PATH+JAVA=${jdk21Path}/bin"]) {
                    sh 'mvn org.sonarsource.scanner.maven:sonar-maven-plugin:3.11.0.3922:sonar'
                }
            }
        }    
    }
}









